Description: complete SDE desktop and application suite for DebION GNU/Linux
 One installation entry point for the SDE session, display server,
 login manager, network and sound services, removable media support
 and integrated SDE applications on Debian testing and DebION.
 .
 It makes SDE-Desktop the default LightDM session and styles the
 LightDM GTK greeter with SDE Aero and the DebION login background.
 .
 This metapackage installs individual maintained components rather than
 another complete desktop environment. Existing user preferences and
 distribution package sources are preserved.

Package: debion-desktop-base
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         desktop-base
Recommends: network-manager,
            iproute2
Description: DebION GNU/Linux artwork and desktop defaults for desktop-base
 Makes the DebION theme the active desktop-base theme: wallpaper, lock
 screen, login screen and GRUB background follow it in every desktop
 (/usr/share/desktop-base/active-theme). It also provides the DebION vendor
 logos and emblems and a DebION Plymouth boot splash.
 .
 Debian's themes stay installed; choose another one with
 "update-alternatives --config desktop-theme".
 .
 Desktop network defaults: NetworkManager connectivity checking against
 Debian's endpoint (/usr/lib/NetworkManager/conf.d/20-debion-connectivity.conf;
 override it in /etc/NetworkManager/conf.d/), and debion-network-check, which
 explains "connected but no internet" (interfaces left to ifupdown, competing
 default routes, a broken /etc/resolv.conf, stale proxies) and can hand
 DHCP/Wi-Fi interfaces from /etc/network/interfaces to NetworkManager.
